@startuml SEQ_17_MELIHAT_DATA_PRAKTIKAN
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-17: Melihat Data Praktikan

actor       "Admin / Asisten / Dosen / Kadep"  as User
boundary    "Browser"                          as Browser
control     "PraktikanController"              as Controller
entity      "Praktikan Model"                  as ModelPK
entity      "PraktikanPraktikum Model"         as Pivot

== Lihat Daftar Praktikan ==

User    ->  Browser    : Buka tab "Praktikan" di halaman praktikum

Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/praktikan

Controller -> Pivot    : Query praktikan berdasarkan praktikum
Pivot --> Controller   : Data praktikan
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman daftar praktikan
Browser    --> User    : Tampilkan tabel praktikan\n(view-only)

== Lihat Detail Praktikan ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik nama praktikan

Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/praktikan/{praktikanId}

Controller -> Pivot    : Query detail praktikan
Pivot --> Controller   : Data praktikan
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman detail praktikan
Browser    --> User    : Profil praktikan: nama, NIM, kelas, status kehadiran, status tugas

@enduml